---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { href } from '../lib/url';
const updated = '2026-11-11';
---
<Base title={`Privacy — ${site.name}`} description={`What ${site.name} does, and doesn’t do, with your data: no cookies, no trackers, and a contact form that goes straight to an inbox.`}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1 class="h2">Short, because there’s little to tell</h1>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>This site is a portfolio. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics and loads nothing from advertising or tracking companies.</p>
        <h2>The contact form</h2>
        <p>What you type in the form (your name, your email address and your message) is sent once, by email, to my inbox, so I can answer you. It isn’t stored in a database and isn’t shared with anyone else. To keep spam out, the form is rate-limited by Cloudflare and may use <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/application-services/products/turnstile/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Turnstile</a>, which checks that a request comes from a browser without showing a puzzle.</p>
        <h2>Films</h2>
        <p>The films are hosted on YouTube. Nothing is loaded from YouTube until you press play; then the player comes from youtube-nocookie.com, YouTube’s privacy-enhanced mode, and <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">Google’s privacy policy</a> applies to what happens inside it.</p>
        <h2>Hosting</h2>
        <p>The site is served by <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener">Cloudflare</a>, which keeps the usual short-lived technical logs to run and protect the service. After your first visit your browser may keep a copy of the site so it opens without a connection; that copy stays on your device.</p>
        <h2>Photos and films</h2>
        <p>Everything on this site and on my channels is my own work. If you’d like to use a photo or a clip, ask through the <a href={href('/#contact')}>contact form</a>.</p>
        <p class="small">Last updated {updated}.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .prose {
    margin-top: var(--s4);
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    margin-top: var(--s5);
    margin-bottom: var(--s2);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .small {
    margin-top: var(--s5);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
</style>
